```css
/* [!code filename:CSS] */
.my-element {
  /* [!code highlight:2] */
  margin: theme(spacing.12);
}
```

This function is deprecated, and we recommend [using CSS theme variables](/docs/theme#using-your-theme-variables) instead."}

